     "text": "A quartz crystal counts the seconds,"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S03",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 276,
   "to": 349,
   "text": "and quartz drifts a few of them every single day.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 276,
     "to": 298,
     "text": "and quartz drifts"
    },
    {
     "from": 299,
     "to": 349,
     "text": "a few of them every single day."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S04",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 360,
   "to": 469,
   "text": "For a wristwatch, that's fine. For the internet, it's a problem.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 360,
     "to": 418,
     "text": "For a wristwatch, that's fine."
    },
    {
     "from": 419,
