    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S08",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 798,
   "to": 923,
   "text": "On a network, wrong time isn't a nuisance. It's a contradiction.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 798,
     "to": 825,
     "text": "On a network,"
    },
    {
     "from": 826,
     "to": 891,
     "text": "wrong time isn't a nuisance."
    },
    {
     "from": 892,
     "to": 923,
     "text": "It's a contradiction."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S09",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 999,
   "to": 1037,
   "text": "So who has the right time?",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 999,
     "to": 1037,
     "text": "So who has the right time?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S10",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1048,
   "to": 1170,
   "text": "Atomic clocks do — the world's best, run by national labs.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1048,
     "to": 1088,
     "text": "Atomic clocks do —"
    },
    {
     "from": 1089,
     "to": 1124,
     "text": "the world's best,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1125,
     "to": 1170,
     "text": "run by national labs."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S11",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1181,
   "to": 1318,
   "text": "GPS satellites each carry one, and whisper the time down to earth.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1181,
     "to": 1262,
     "text": "GPS satellites each carry one,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1263,
     "to": 1318,
     "text": "and whisper the time down to earth."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1329,
   "to": 1402,
   "text": "But your laptop can't afford an atomic clock.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1329,
     "to": 1369,
     "text": "But your laptop can't afford"
    },
    {
     "from": 1370,
     "to": 1402,
     "text": "an atomic clock."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S13",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1413,
   "to": 1501,
   "text": "So it asks a server — and that server asks another,",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1413,
     "to": 1459,
     "text": "So it asks a server —"
    },
    {
     "from": 1460,
     "to": 1501,
     "text": "and that server asks another,"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1512,
   "to": 1565,
   "text": "each one a little further from the source.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1512,
     "to": 1538,
     "text": "each one a little further"
    },
    {
     "from": 1539,
     "to": 1565,
     "text": "from the source."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1576,
   "to": 1645,
   "text": "NTP calls each layer a stratum:",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1576,
     "to": 1645,
     "text": "NTP calls each layer a stratum:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S16",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1656,
   "to": 1840,
   "text": "stratum one talks to the atom; stratum two asks stratum one — and so on, down to fifteen.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1656,
     "to": 1710,
     "text": "stratum one talks to the atom;"
    },
    {
     "from": 1711,
